{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05185","headline":"祭汾阴乐章 太和 · 王晙","name":"祭汾阴乐章 太和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"於穆圣皇，六叶重光。\n太原刻颂，后土疏场。\n宝鼎呈符，歊云孕祥。\n礼乐备矣，降福穰穰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王晙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05185.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05185","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}